==== hyperbricks yaml {!{api_render}} ====
api_render:
  - type: api_render
  - endpoint: https://example.com/api
  - inline: <div>INLINE</div>
  - method: GET
==== explainer ====
Inline Go template source. Use a normal YAML string, or a YAML block scalar when the source spans multiple lines.
